# 詞: 銀包

1. 我唔記得帶銀包出街，而家冇錢搭車返屋企。 (I forgot to bring my wallet out, and now I don't have money to take the bus home.)
2. 佢個銀包俾人偷咗，入面仲有身份證同埋信用卡。 (His wallet was stolen, and it also had his ID card and credit cards inside.)
3. 你個銀包跌咗喺地下，快啲執返啦。 (Your wallet fell on the ground, pick it up quickly.)
4. 我買咗個新銀包俾自己做生日禮物。 (I bought a new wallet for myself as a birthday gift.)
5. 呢個銀包係真皮造嘅，所以貴啲都值得買。 (This wallet is made of genuine leather, so it's worth buying even though it's more expensive.)
6. 佢打開銀包，攞咗張一百蚊出嚟俾我。 (He opened his wallet and took out a hundred-dollar bill to give me.)
7. 我個銀包入面得返廿蚊，唔夠錢食飯。 (I only have twenty dollars left in my wallet, not enough money to eat.)
8. 阿媽叫我檢查下銀包有冇漏咗嘢。 (My mom told me to check my wallet to see if I left anything behind.)
9. 佢個銀包好鼓，睇嚟收埋唔少錢。 (His wallet is very bulging, looks like he's hiding quite a bit of money in there.)
10. 我搵極都搵唔到個銀包，唔通放咗喺公司？ (I've been searching everywhere but can't find my wallet, could I have left it at the office?)

完成10句例句 [end of text]


